 Contact import for leadpool.

 Each contact has a unique id. When two imports overlap, a contact can appear more than once with the same id (equal id, different object). dedupe(contacts) returns one contact per id, keeping the first seen. Identity is the id, never object identity.
+
+## Merging
+
+mergeImports(...lists) flattens the lists and dedupes them by id.
+
+## Ordering
+
+byName(contacts) returns the contacts sorted by name without modifying the input.
